OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance calls surge to about
OL,4,A1,200 in July
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey ambulance teams responded to
OL,7,Falmost 1,200 calls in July - about 300
OL,8,Fmore than its monthly average.
OL,10,FThe ambulance service said it responded
OL,11,Fto 1,194 calls last month, with its
OL,12,Frecent monthly averages being closer to
OL,13,F900.
OL,15,FThe service said of all the calls
OL,16,Fattended 30% of people were checked,
OL,17,Ftreated and let go at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
