OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance calls surge to about
OL,4,A1,200 in July
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt asked people calling the emergency
OL,7,Fservice to only do so if seriously ill
OL,8,For injured or if their was life at
OL,9,Frisk. It asked people to consider other
OL,10,Fcare pathways including self-care,
OL,11,Fcommunity pharmacies and their GPs.
